# Care Console lead API. Consumed server-side only, by api/careconsole.js on
# Vercel and netlify/functions/careconsole.js on Netlify. Deliberately not
# VITE_-prefixed, so it never reaches the client bundle.
#
# Copy this file to .env for local development, and set the same variable in the
# Vercel / Netlify dashboard for deployed environments.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CARE_API_URL=
